		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		white-space: nowrap;
		color: light-dark(var(--ion-color-primary), var(--ion-color-cool-grey-c1));
	}

	&__ionos,
	&__product {
		display: block;
		color: light-dark(var(--ion-color-primary), var(--ion-color-cool-grey-c1));
	}
}
</style>
